            "max_check_attempts": 5,
            "notes": "Checks the remote replication pairs of a Huawei OceanStor Pacific storage system via the REST API (/dsware/service/REPLICATIONPAIR endpoint). Alerts when a pair is faulty or has stopped mirroring, and optionally when its last synchronization is older than the given thresholds. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy and shorter output via --brief.",
